<title>USA: High Plains Wheat - Basis bids hold at firm levels.</title>
<headline>High Plains Wheat - Basis bids hold at firm levels.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hard red winter wheat basis bids were holding at recently established stronger levels on Thursday in slow conditions, grain dealers said.</p>
<p>Dealers said the recent run-up in futures prices had turned farmers bullish and there was little selling interest from producers.</p>
<p>&quot;The farmers are trying to milk it (the rally) for every penny but if there was a break in the market they would come back (and sell),&quot; one Oklahoma dealer said.</p>
<p>Bitterly cold weather across much of Kansas was also helping to slow movement.</p>
